  "description": "One unshaded oblique wireframe cube. The front square has D upper-left, M upper-right, K lower-right, A lower-left. The back square is translated up-right: C upper-left, N upper-right, P lower-right, B lower-left. All eight vertices are labelled, but have no separate source dot markers. Nine edges are solid and the three edges incident to the concealed back-bottom-left B are dashed: AB, BC, BP. The projected BC line crosses DM and projected BP crosses MK without a vertex or junction at either crossing. No face hatching, fill, dimensions, ticks, or answer indications.",
